(text "Direct W5500 Ethernet, all-mode autonegotiation. Preserve ESP32 SPI/reset/IRQ nets.\nJ13: CETUS J1B1211CCD, matching WIZnet reference. Separate TX/RX centre taps.\nETH_SHIELD is connector-local and is not a galvanic short to board ground.\nPCB placement, shield coupling, routing, ordering and crystal-load review IN PROGRESS; NOT FOR FABRICATION." (at 25 370 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid c5cecde9-6941-4c36-b755-664089cc98f4))
